  "prefLabel": "En 502.10 Jurisdictional LPG system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 502.10 \"Jurisdictional LPG system\" means:\n\n(1) A system involving a single source which serves 10 or more customers; or\n\n(2) A system where more than one customer is located in a public place.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
